BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Begotten (1989)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261023T183500
DTSTAMP:20261024T000000Z
UID:begotten-4k-restoration-2026-10-23-17:00:00-07:00
DESCRIPTION:“Begotten” has no characters in the ordinary sense. Its fi
 nal credits name three principal figures:\n\nGod Killing Himself. Mother E
 arth. Son of Earth — Flesh on Bone\n\nThe entire film is what those name
 s do to each other and to the earth. God Killing Himself tears open his bo
 dy and dies. Mother Earth rises from what remains and takes his seed into 
 herself. She gives birth to Son of Earth — Flesh on Bone. He is cast int
 o a barren world\, seized by the Nomads\, tortured\, killed\, and briefly 
 returned to life by his mother. The Nomads destroy her too. The Robed Figu
 res gather what remains of mother and son\, grind their bodies down\, and 
 return them to the soil. The ground flowers.\n\nE. Elias Merhige\, United 
 States\, 1989\, 72 min\, English intertitles\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/fi
 lms/begotten-4k-restoration/\n\nEstimated start: 17:20
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
