SUMMARY:Late Autumn (1960)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T183000
DTSTAMP:20261129T000000Z
UID:late-autumn-2026-11-28-16:00:00-08:00
DESCRIPTION:The great actress and Ozu regular Setsuko Hara plays a mother 
 gently trying to persuade her daughter to marry in this glowing portrait o
 f family love and conflict—a reworking of Ozu’s 1949 masterpiece Late 
 Spring.\n\nYasujirō Ozu\, 1960\, Japan\, 128 min\, in Japanese with Engli
 sh subtitles\n\nhttps://nwfilmforum.org/films/late-autumn/\n\nEstimated st
 art: 16:20
LOCATION:Northwest Film Forum\, 1515 12th Ave\, Seattle\, WA 98122
END:VEVENT
